Basic STL headers (<optional>, <string>, <vector>) with system libc++.

History: passed vacuously pre-conformance (truncated containers, havoc'd
operations); reclassified KNOWNBUG when the member-typedef conformance fix
([temp.inst]/1-2, [dcl.typedef]) made symex execute the real containers,
which then did not complete within resources.  Re-flipped to CORE by the
[class.mem.general]/7 complete-class static-member-initializer fix: in-class
initializers reading class-local typedefs/siblings now resolve instead of
degrading to nondet, and verification completes in ~16s.
See doc/architectural/cpp-class-template-instantiation-plan.md.
